A line block's last body line keeps its backslash

```
::: |
a\
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a<br>
</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a  \
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a
%%
b
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a<br>
<br>
b</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a \
%% c
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <br>
</p>
</div>
```
